          <p>One of the most common use cases for our tool is creating a <strong>video screenshot</strong> collection. Whether you're capturing memorable moments from a family video, extracting frames from a gameplay recording, or saving specific moments from an educational video, our intuitive interface makes the process simple and efficient.</p>
